  <sys:String x:Key="OptionalDiagnosticLogTitle">Optional diagnostic log</sys:String><sys:String x:Key="DebugDisabledHelp">Debug is off by default. When enabled, TextAid creates one log for the current session in %LOCALAPPDATA%\TextAid.</sys:String><sys:String x:Key="EnableDebugLogLabel">Enable debug log</sys:String><sys:String x:Key="EnableFullLogLabel">Enable full log (contains diagnostic text)</sys:String><sys:String x:Key="FullLogWarning">Full log stays on this computer and is never sent automatically. It can include input, prompts, output, and raw error messages so support can diagnose a problem. You may obfuscate passages in Notepad before sharing it. API keys, tokens, passwords, and secrets are always redacted.</sys:String><sys:String x:Key="OpenDebugFolderLabel">Open debug-log folder</sys:String><sys:String x:Key="SafeLogHelp">The log contains technical event names, failure categories, and exception types only. It never records API keys, secrets, clipboard contents, input text, generated output, or prompts.</sys:String>
